mer_name}},</p><p>A new OrbitFS invoice has been issued for your account.</p><table role=\\\\"presentation\\\\" width=\\\\"100%\\\\" cellspacing=\\\\"0\\\\" cellpadding=\\\\"0\\\\" style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px\\\\"><tr><td style=\\\\"padding:11px 16px;color:#6b7280\\\\">Invoice</td><td style=\\\\"padding:11px 16px;text-align:right;font-weight:700\\\\">{{invoice_number}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\\"padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280\\\\">Total</td><td style=\\\\"padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;font-weight:700\\\\">{{invoice_total}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\\"padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280\\\\">Due date</td><td style=\\\\"padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;font-weight:700\\\\">{{due_date}}</td></tr></table><p><a href=\\\\"{{invoice_url}}\\\\" style=\\\\"display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:#2563eb;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700\\\\">View invoice</a></p><p>You can review and pay this invoice through the Customer Portal.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS Billing</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\\\nA new OrbitFS invoice has been issued for your account.\\\\n\\\\nInvoice: {{invoice_number}}\\\\nTotal: {{invoice_total}}\\\\nDue date: {{due_date}}\\\\n\\\\nView invoice: {{invoice_url}}\\\\n\\\\nYou can review and pay this invoice through the Customer Portal.\\\\n\\\\nRegards,\\\\nOrbitFS Billing","from_account":"billing@orbitfs.cc","enabled":true,"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:17:46.080841+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:30:00.853001+00:00"}'::jsonb) r;\nINSERT INTO public.mail_templates (id, template_key, name, category, subject, html, text_body, from_account, enabled, created_at, updated_at) SELECT r.id, r.template_key, r.name, r.category, r.subject, r.html, r.text_body, r.from_account, r.enabled, r.created_at, r.updated_at FROM jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.mail_templates, E'{"id":"5906f7b0-cfea-4702-b5a6-a6ca3e1f88e2","template_key":"order_created","name":"Order confirmation","category":"Orders","subject":"OrbitFS order {{order_number}} received","html":"<h2 style=\\\\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\\\\">Order received</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>We have received your OrbitFS order and it is now being processed.</p><table role=\\\\"presentation\\\\" width=\\\\"100%\\\\" cellspacing=\\\\"0\\\\" cellpadding=\\\\"0\\\\" style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px\\\\"><tr><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;color:#6b7280\\\\">Order</td><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;text-align:right;font-weight:700\\\\">#{{order_number}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280\\\\">Total</td><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;font-weight:700\\\\">{{order_total}}</td></tr></table><p>If payment, approval or provisioning is required, the current status will be shown in the Customer Portal.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS Billing</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\\\nWe have received your OrbitFS order {{order_number}}.\\\\n\\\\nOrder total: {{order_total}}\\\\n\\\\nYour order is now being processed. If payment, approval or provisioning is required, the current status will be shown in the Customer Portal.\\\\n\\\\nRegards,\\\\nOrbitFS Billing","from_account":"billing@orbitfs.cc","enabled":true,"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:17:46.080841+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:30:00.853001+00:00"}'::jsonb) r;\nINSERT INTO public.mail_templates (id, template_key, name, category, subject, html, text_body, from_account, enabled, created_at, updated_at) SELECT r.id, r.template_key, r.name, r.category, r.subject, r.html, r.text_body, r.from_account, r.enabled, r.created_at, r.updated_at FROM jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.mail_templates, E'{"id":"be956e51-b73e-4920-a80b-7a3dd34ff5fb","template_key":"customer_created","name":"Customer welcome","category":"Customers","subject":"Welcome to OrbitFS, {{customer_name}}","html":"<h2 style=\\\\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\\\\">Welcome to OrbitFS</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>Your OrbitFS account has been created successfully.</p><div style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;padding:16px 18px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px\\\\"><strong style=\\\\"display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:#111827\\\\">Your Customer Portal is ready</strong><span>You can now manage your orders, invoices, licences, downloads and support requests from one place.</span></div><p>If you did not expect this account to be created, please contact OrbitFS Support.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\\\nYour OrbitFS account has been created successfully. You can now sign in to the Customer Portal to manage your orders, invoices, licences, downloads and support requests.\\\\n\\\\nIf you did not expect this account to be created, please contact OrbitFS Support.\\\\n\\\\nRegards,\\\\nOrbitFS","from_account":"noreply@orbitfs.cc","enabled":true,"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:43:19.019546+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:30:00.853001+00:00"}'::jsonb) r;\nINSERT INTO public.mail_templates (id, template_key, name, category, subject, html, text_body, from_account, enabled, created_at, updated_at) SELECT r.id, r.template_key, r.name, r.category, r.subject, r.html, r.text_body, r.from_account, r.enabled, r.created_at, r.updated_at FROM jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.mail_templates, E'{"id":"233f8904-e2c0-4fbf-9d3b-e4fc020a0a77","template_key":"order_paid","name":"Order paid","category":"Orders","subject":"Payment received for order {{order_number}}","html":"<h2 style=\\\\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\\\\">Payment received</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>We have received payment for your OrbitFS order.</p><table role=\\\\"presentation\\\\" width=\\\\"100%\\\\" cellspacing=\\\\"0\\\\" cellpadding=\\\\"0\\\\" style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px\\\\"><tr><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;color:#166534\\\\">Order</td><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;text-align:right;font-weight:700;color:#166534\\\\">#{{order_number}}</td></tr><tr><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #bbf7d0;color:#166534\\\\">Amount</td><td style=\\\\"padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #bbf7d0;text-align:right;font-weight:700;color:#166534\\\\">{{order_total}}</td></tr></table><p>Your order will now continue through any required activation or provisioning steps. You can follow its progress in the Customer Portal.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS Billing</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\\\nWe have received payment for OrbitFS order {{order_number}}.\\\\n\\\\nOrder total: {{order_total}}\\\\n\\\\nYour order will now continue through any required activation or provisioning steps. You can follow its progress in the Customer Portal.\\\\n\\\\nRegards,\\\\nOrbitFS Billing","from_account":"billing@orbitfs.cc","enabled":true,"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:43:19.019546+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:30:00.853001+00:00"}'::jsonb) r;\nINSERT INTO public.mail_templates (id, template_key, name, category, subject, html, text_body, from_account, enabled, created_at, updated_at) SELECT r.id, r.template_key, r.name, r.category, r.subject, r.html, r.text_body, r.from_account, r.enabled, r.created_at, r.updated_at FROM jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.mail_templates, E'{"id":"50b859b3-1f12-4875-93ea-078c59b6d02b","template_key":"service_activated","name":"Service activated","category":"Products & Services","subject":"Your OrbitFS service is now active","html":"<h2 style=\\\\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#166534\\\\">Service activated</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>Your OrbitFS service associated with order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> has been activated successfully.</p><div style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;padding:16px 18px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px\\\\"><strong style=\\\\"color:#166534\\\\">Status: Active</strong><br><span style=\\\\"color:#166534\\\\">Your service is ready to use.</span></div><p>You can access and manage the service, including any associated licences or downloads, through the Customer Portal.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\\\nYour OrbitFS service associated with order {{order_number}} has been activated successfully.\\\\n\\\\nYou can now access and manage the service, including any associated licences or downloads, through the Customer Portal.\\\\n\\\\nRegards,\\\\nOrbitFS","from_account":"noreply@orbitfs.cc","enabled":true,"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:43:19.019546+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:30:00.853001+00:00"}'::jsonb) r;\nINSERT INTO public.mail_templates (id, template_key, name, category, subject, html, text_body, from_account, enabled, created_at, updated_at) SELECT r.id, r.template_key, r.name, r.category, r.subject, r.html, r.text_body, r.from_account, r.enabled, r.created_at, r.updated_at FROM jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.mail_templates, E'{"id":"05ec4039-6003-4948-b70f-ae9c0c8e95ad","template_key":"service_suspended","name":"Service suspended","category":"Products & Services","subject":"OrbitFS service suspended - order {{order_number}}","html":"<h2 style=\\\\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#92400e\\\\">Service suspended</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>Your OrbitFS service associated with order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> has been suspended.</p><div style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;padding:16px 18px;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:10px\\\\"><span style=\\\\"display:block;color:#92400e;font-size:13px\\\\">Reason</span><strong style=\\\\"display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#92400e\\\\">{{reason}}</strong></div><p>The affected service will remain unavailable until the suspension is resolved or removed. Please review the latest service and billing status in the Customer Portal.</p><p>If you believe this action is incorrect, please contact OrbitFS Support.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\\\nYour OrbitFS service associated with order {{order_number}} has been suspended.\\\\n\\\\nReason: {{reason}}\\\\n\\\\nThe affected service will remain unavailable until the suspension is resolved or removed. Please review the latest service and billing status in the Customer Portal.\\\\n\\\\nIf you believe this action is incorrect, please contact OrbitFS Support.\\\\n\\\\nRegards,\\\\nOrbitFS","from_account":"billing@orbitfs.cc","enabled":true,"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:43:19.019546+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:30:00.853001+00:00"}'::jsonb) r;\nINSERT INTO public.mail_templates (id, template_key, name, category, subject, html, text_body, from_account, enabled, created_at, updated_at) SELECT r.id, r.template_key, r.name, r.category, r.subject, r.html, r.text_body, r.from_account, r.enabled, r.created_at, r.updated_at FROM jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.mail_templates, E'{"id":"6a1e49ae-92ea-4942-8439-fceeab26bbe6","template_key":"service_unsuspended","name":"Service restored","category":"Products & Services","subject":"Your OrbitFS service has been restored","html":"<h2 style=\\\\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#166534\\\\">Service restored</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>Your OrbitFS service associated with order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> has been restored and is active again.</p><div style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;padding:16px 18px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;border-radius:10px\\\\"><strong style=\\\\"color:#166534\\\\">Status: Active</strong></div><p>You can confirm the current service status in the Customer Portal.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\\\nYour OrbitFS service associated with order {{order_number}} has been restored and is active again.\\\\n\\\\nYou can confirm the current service status in the Customer Portal.\\\\n\\\\nRegards,\\\\nOrbitFS","from_account":"noreply@orbitfs.cc","enabled":true,"created_at":"2026-09-01T06:43:19.019546+00:00","updated_at":"2026-09-02T21:30:00.853001+00:00"}'::jsonb) r;\nINSERT INTO public.mail_templates (id, template_key, name, category, subject, html, text_body, from_account, enabled, created_at, updated_at) SELECT r.id, r.template_key, r.name, r.category, r.subject, r.html, r.text_body, r.from_account, r.enabled, r.created_at, r.updated_at FROM jsonb_populate_record(NULL::public.mail_templates, E'{"id":"5f9a3fe0-3dbf-4124-a47e-b5120da59c3e","template_key":"service_terminated","name":"Service terminated","category":"Products & Services","subject":"OrbitFS service terminated - order {{order_number}}","html":"<h2 style=\\\\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#991b1b\\\\">Service terminated</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>Your OrbitFS service associated with order <strong>#{{order_number}}</strong> has been terminated.</p><div style=\\\\"margin:20px 0;padding:16px 18px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-radius:10px\\\\"><span style=\\\\"display:block;color:#991b1b;font-size:13px\\\\">Reason</span><strong style=\\\\"display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#991b1b\\\\">{{reason}}</strong></div><p>The affected service is no longer active. Associated licences or service access may also have been revoked as part of the termination.</p><p>If you require clarification, please contact OrbitFS Support.</p><p style=\\\\"margin-top:24px\\\\">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS</strong></p>","text_body":"Hi {{customer_name}},\\\\n\\