4f31ecd4-a9ea-433c-891e-87e0b89611ba	invoice_created	Invoice created	Invoices	OrbitFS invoice {{invoice_number}}	<h2 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#111827">New invoice issued</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>A new OrbitFS invoice has been issued for your account.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:20px 0;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px"><tr><td style="padding:11px 16px;color:#6b7280">Invoice</td><td style="padding:11px 16px;text-align:right;font-weight:700">{{invoice_number}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280">Total</td><td style="padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;font-weight:700">{{invoice_total}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280">Due date</td><td style="padding:11px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;font-weight:700">{{due_date}}</td></tr></table><p><a href="{{invoice_url}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;background:#2563eb;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;font-weight:700">View invoice</a></p><p>You can review and pay this invoice through the Customer Portal.</p><p style="margin-top:24px">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS Billing</strong></p>	Hi {{customer_name}},\n\nA new OrbitFS invoice has been issued for your account.\n\nInvoice: {{invoice_number}}\nTotal: {{invoice_total}}\nDue date: {{due_date}}\n\nView invoice: {{invoice_url}}\n\nYou can review and pay this invoice through the Customer Portal.\n\nRegards,\nOrbitFS Billing	billing@orbitfs.cc	t	2026-09-01 06:17:46.080841+00	2026-09-02 21:30:00.853001+00
5906f7b0-cfea-4702-b5a6-a6ca3e1f88e2	order_created	Order confirmation	Orders	OrbitFS order {{order_number}} received	<h2 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:22px;color:#111827">Order received</h2><p>Hi {{customer_name}},</p><p>We have received your OrbitFS order and it is now being processed.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="margin:20px 0;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:10px"><tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;color:#6b7280">Order</td><td style="padding:12px 16px;text-align:right;font-weight:700">#{{order_number}}</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280">Total</td><td style="padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:right;font-weight:700">{{order_total}}</td></tr></table><p>If payment, approval or provisioning is required, the current status will be shown in the Customer Portal.</p><p style="margin-top:24px">Regards,<br><strong>OrbitFS Billing</strong></p>	Hi {{customer_name}},\n\nWe have received your OrbitFS order {{order_number}}.\n\nOrder total: {{order_total}}\n\nYour order is now being processed. If payment, approval or provisioning is required, the current status will be shown in the Customer Portal.\n\nRegards,\nOrbitFS Billing	billing@orbitfs.cc	t	2026-09-01 06:17:46.080841+00	2026-09-02 21:30:00.853001+00
